{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04259","headline":"寒夜独坐游子多怀简知己 · 骆宾王","name":"寒夜独坐游子多怀简知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故乡眇千里，离忧积万端。\n鹑服长悲碎，蜗庐未卜安。\n富钩徒有想，贫铗爲谁弹。\n柳秋风叶脆，荷晓露文团。\n晚金丛岸菊，余佩下幽兰。\n伐木伤心易，维桑归去难。\n独有孤明月，时照客庭寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}